[{"result":{"data":{"json":{"id":"949","stub":{"id":"949","section":"C) CR45/Pike Lake Road to Cascade River State Park (3.5 miles)","altname":"","river":"Cascade","difficulty":"IVtoV","states":["USA-MNN"]},"primaryGaugeStatus":null,"pointOfInterests":[{"type":"put-in","description":null,"id":"112143","location":{"latitude":"47.7466011047363","longitude":"-90.5253982543945"},"name":"Put In","distance":"0","photoID":null,"difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"takeout","description":null,"id":"117424","location":{"latitude":"47.7125015258789","longitude":"-90.5282974243164"},"name":"Take Out","distance":"3.5","photoID":null,"difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false}],"alerts":[],"photos":[{"id":"12155","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"8874","description":"","caption":"Looking up at Hidden Falls","poi_name":"","subject":"","author":"Jesse B","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/12155","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/12155"}},{"id":"882861","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"885536","description":"","caption":"Hidden Falls ","poi_name":"","subject":"Jonathan Sisley","author":"Jonathan Sisley","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/882861","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/882861"}},{"id":"884164","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"886863","description":"Joel Decker on Discretion Drop at higher flows. ","caption":"Discretion Drop","poi_name":null,"subject":null,"author":"Andy McMurray","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/884164","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/884164"}}],"detail":{"id":"949","permitUrl":"","permitInfo":"","description":"Incredible run, one of the best in the upper midwest!\n\nNot far downstream from the put in, the action starts with **_Hidden Falls_**. Scout (river left) this long, steep, curving slide with a wild finish as it splashes into a keepy looking hole.\n\nThe run continues with numerous steep, technical rapids, sweet sliding falls, boof ledges, and great scenery. Many of the drops deserve scouting, as a log in the wrong place would be critical.\n\nThis reach ends with a 0.5 mile carry out to Hwy.61, to avoid the falls of the 'Cascades of the Cascade' within the state park. Scout the take-out above the falls before your run (using good trails and boardwalks in the state park), to know which eddy to _definitely catch_ before the point of no return. (While the final half-mile can be run, and is described as a separate reach, it is most often done at levels which would _not_ coincide with _this_ run.)\n\nVideo (via YouTube) shows a fine (nearly 10 minute) mix of headcam and shore footage:","averageGradient":"164","maxGradient":"177","length":"2.8","correlations":[],"pointOfInterestIDs":["112143","117424"],"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[-90.52554014296848,47.74662178679962],[-90.52562896992612,47.746012392555315],[-90.525936503259,47.744824925890505],[-90.52607290325881,47.74436812589124],[-90.52586996992574,47.74418532589152],[-90.52563330325944,47.74402512589177],[-90.52576950325926,47.74368252589227],[-90.52624390325849,47.743591592559085],[-90.52797116992254,47.743638925892355],[-90.5283779032552,47.74343372589266],[-90.52950016992014,47.741310325895995],[-90.52950236992012,47.74025952589761],[-90.52973990325309,47.74005419256457],[-90.53075636991815,47.739872325898205],[-90.53163710325015,47.73980459256495],[-90.5318747032498,47.73953072589876],[-90.53167236991675,47.7390737925661],[-90.53123376991743,47.73831939256729],[-90.53123536991745,47.737519925901836],[-90.53144030325046,47.73662919256992],[-90.53130636991733,47.73594379257099],[-90.53188316991645,47.735350325905245],[-90.53296836991473,47.734643192573],[-90.53401996991312,47.73370759257443],[-90.53490170324505,47.733068